    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46578" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">summōtor</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">subm-</span></b> ), ōris, m.
